n after summand permutations. A second polynomial certificate separates a distinguished curve from a specified labelled comparison-family orbit closure. Rational coefficient tables and exact-arithmetic checkers verify all 4,096 tensor identities."}]],"$Ld"]}],"$Le","$Lf","$undefined","$L10","$L11","$L12",false]}]]}]]}],"$L13"]
